flowchart TD
 A[Order received] --> V[Validate DAG + contracts]
 V --> F{Ready independent checks?}
 F -->|Yes| P[Parallel fraud + address]
 P --> G[Fan-in result]
 G --> I[Reserve inventory]
 I --> Y[Authorize payment]
 Y --> S[Book shipping]
 S -->|Success| N[Notify customer]
 S -->|Failure| C[Compensate payment]
 C --> R[Release inventory]
 R --> Z{All compensations succeeded?}
 Z -->|Yes| D[Mark compensated]
 Z -->|No| H[compensation_required + operator task]
 N --> O[Mark completed]
